# Dr. Aparana Ghosh - Gynecologist Clinic Website

## Project Overview
This is a Next.js 14 medical clinic website for Dr. Aparana Ghosh, a gynecologist in Chembur, Mumbai. The website showcases gynecological services, treatments, patient testimonials, and health tips.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **State Management**: React (no global state needed currently)

## Project Structure
```
draparana/
├── app/
│   ├── components/          # Reusable React components
│   │   ├── Navbar.tsx       # Navigation with Call/WhatsApp CTAs
│   │   └── Footer.tsx       # Footer with contact info
│   ├── about/
│   │   └── page.tsx         # About Doctor page
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── page.tsx         # Services listing page
│   │   └── [service]/       # Individual service pages
│   ├── contact/
│   │   └── page.tsx         # Contact page with Google Maps
│   ├── testimonials/
│   │   └── page.tsx         # Patient testimonials
│   ├── treatments/
│   │   └── page.tsx         # Before/After treatments gallery
│   ├── blog/
│   │   └── page.tsx         # Health tips blog
│   ├── layout.tsx           # Root layout with Navbar/Footer
│   ├── page.tsx             # Homepage
│   └── globals.css          # Global styles
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json
└── tailwind.config.js
```

## Key Features
- Medical clinic website for gynecologist
- Service pages: Laser Hair Reduction, Cosmetic Gynecology, HIFU, HRT, Scar Reduction
- Contact page with Google Maps integration
- Patient testimonials section
- Before/After treatment gallery
- Health tips blog
- Mobile-responsive design
- Clear Call-to-Action buttons (Call Now, WhatsApp)

## Coding Conventions
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes for styling
- Use Lucide React for icons
- All pages use Next.js App Router
- Metadata exported for SEO
- Contact information: Phone, WhatsApp, Email, Address
- Medical/healthcare color scheme (blue tones)

## Important Notes
- Contact phone: Update `+919876543210` throughout
- WhatsApp: Update WhatsApp links
- Email: Update `info@draparana.com`
- Address: Update clinic address in Footer
- Google Maps: Replace placeholder embed code
- All prices/services in Indian context (Mumbai, Chembur)
- Medical terminology and patient-friendly language

## Component Patterns
- Use 'use client' directive for client components
- Use Link from next/link for navigation
- Use Image from next/image for optimized images
- Metadata exported for SEO optimization
- Contact info managed via helper functions

## Styling Guidelines
- Primary colors: Medical blue (#0284c7, #0369a1)
- Success color: Green (#16a34a) for WhatsApp buttons
- Use rounded-full for buttons
- Use rounded-2xl for cards
- Professional, clean medical theme
- High contrast for accessibility

## SEO Requirements
- Each page has proper meta title and description
- Keywords: gynecologist Chembur, services Mumbai, etc.
- Structured content with H1, H2, H3 headings
- 600-1000 words per service page
- Image alt tags for accessibility
- Patient-friendly language

## Contact Information Structure
- Phone: Clickable tel: links
- WhatsApp: Clickable wa.me links
- Email: Clickable mailto: links
- Address: Full clinic address
- Clinic hours: Displayed in footer and contact page

## Service Pages Structure
Each service page should include:
- Hero section with title
- Detailed description (600-1000 words)
- Benefits list
- Treatment process
- Why choose us section
- Call-to-action for booking

## Medical Website Best Practices
- Professional, trustworthy design
- Clear appointment booking CTAs
- Easy contact methods (phone, WhatsApp)
- Patient testimonials for trust
- Before/After photos (with consent)
- Health tips/blog for SEO
- Mobile-first responsive design
- Fast loading times
- Accessible design (WCAG compliant)

